          "settings": {
            "title": "1. What makes EZENTI garments different?",
            "answer": "<p>EZENTI garments are created with a focus on intentional design, premium materials, and meaningful simplicity. Every element—from the fabric to the placement of each detail—is carefully considered to create pieces that feel balanced, refined, and authentic. Rather than following trends, we focus on identity, presence, and quiet confidence. The founders are directly involved in overseeing the quality control of every garment, ensuring it meets our absolute standard before reaching you.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. What inspires the minimal aesthetic of EZENTI?",
            "answer": "<p>Minimalism is a core philosophy of our brand. We believe that simplicity allows the true essence of a design to speak clearly without unnecessary noise. By focusing on clean compositions and intentional placement, we create garments that carry meaning through balance and restraint. True expression can exist in clarity and purpose<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Are EZENTI garments and Collector Editions limited?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. EZENTI produces all garments in small, carefully controlled quantities to maintain our high standards of quality and craftsmanship. Furthermore, our Collector Edition pieces—which explore more expressive designs while retaining our core identity—are strictly limited to 100 garments per design, making every release a finite chapter in the brand’s journey.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
        "question-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Do EZENTI designs change with each collection?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Each EZENTI collection explores new ideas, concepts, and creative directions while staying true to the identity and philosophy of the brand. While certain elements of our design language naturally carry over, every release is developed with its own distinct intention, balance, and creative perspective.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
        "question_xj4DAB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. How are EZENTI garments produced?",
            "answer": "<p>EZENTI garments are produced through a carefully controlled, small-scale process where attention to detail is prioritized at every step. This hands-on approach allows us to maintain the precision, intention, and structural integrity that define the brand.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
