          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6. How should I care for my EZENTI garments?",
            "answer": "<p>To preserve the quality of the fabric and design, please wash your garment inside out in cold water with similar colors. Avoid bleach and do not iron directly on printed areas. Air drying is strongly recommended, as high heat from dryers may affect the heavy cotton and printed details.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": ""
          }
