          "settings": {
            "title": "7. How do I choose the correct size?",
            "answer": "<p>EZENTI garments are engineered with a modern, relaxed silhouette that balances comfort and structure. We recommend reviewing the Size Guide on each product page for detailed measurements. If you prefer a more oversized drape, consider sizing up. For further assistance, our support team is available before you place your order.<br/><br/></p>",
