            "answer": "<p>Our infrastructure processes secure transactions across all major global networks. We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, and Diners Club. For a streamlined digital checkout, we also support Apple Pay, Google Pay, PayPal, and Shop Pay.<br/><br/></p>",
